# Claude Code. Project conventions (skills, agents, hooks, shared settings) are
# checked in so every contributor gets them; machine-local config — the dev-server
# launch profile and personal permission grants — is not portable, so it stays out.
.claude/*
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/settings.json

